WEBVTT

00:49.632 --> 00:51.134
You're letting your guard down!

00:51.217 --> 00:52.260
Yuzuha!

01:11.279 --> 01:12.113
Father.

01:21.164 --> 01:22.457
I will survive!

03:17.739 --> 03:18.615
What?

03:54.943 --> 03:56.027
How was it?

03:56.110 --> 03:57.695
No good. I can't find any leads.

03:58.780 --> 03:59.614
In any case,

04:00.114 --> 04:02.700
let's gather anything that we can use.

04:14.545 --> 04:17.215
FURNITURE AND INTERIOR GOODS FLOOR

04:17.298 --> 04:18.466
I knew it. It's no good.

04:18.549 --> 04:20.760
All the IC chips have been destroyed.

04:23.346 --> 04:25.265
Video cameras, digital clocks.

04:25.848 --> 04:28.101
Anything that operates
via an electronic circuit board

04:28.184 --> 04:29.894
won't function at all.

04:32.021 --> 04:34.315
But things like this still work, huh?

04:34.899 --> 04:37.652
Since they don't have IC chips installed.

04:40.071 --> 04:41.072
What does that mean?

04:43.074 --> 04:44.701
Maybe…

04:45.785 --> 04:48.204
- Hurry up!
- Look, fireworks!

04:53.418 --> 04:55.712
It might have been
an electromagnetic pulse attack.

04:57.463 --> 04:59.465
I've read about this on the Internet.

04:59.549 --> 05:01.509
When fired into the stratosphere,

05:01.592 --> 05:05.638
it's a weapon capable of destroying
the electronics in an entire city.

05:06.931 --> 05:08.016
Seriously?

05:13.604 --> 05:16.357
So why is this still operating?

05:18.985 --> 05:19.986
I have no idea.

05:22.405 --> 05:23.406
VISA
RYOHEI ARISU

05:23.489 --> 05:24.407
REMAINING DAYS: 3

05:25.241 --> 05:26.242
What?

05:38.796 --> 05:41.132
It's useless if we can't charge it, huh?

05:46.554 --> 05:48.765
This area looks safe.

05:57.482 --> 05:59.859
All right.
This will serve as a decent weapon.

06:00.860 --> 06:02.528
What are you going to fight against?

06:05.531 --> 06:06.491
Zombies?

06:11.913 --> 06:13.831
You can't use electricity
and gas either, right?

06:13.915 --> 06:16.250
But I can still use the portable stove.

06:16.334 --> 06:18.628
Batteries work.
So we can use flashlights, too.

06:18.711 --> 06:20.463
Don't you feel like eating something warm?

06:45.488 --> 06:46.572
I feel alive again!

06:48.241 --> 06:49.534
Nice and hot!

06:49.617 --> 06:51.869
We haven't eaten anything since yesterday.

06:54.580 --> 06:57.208
What were the three of you doing?

06:57.291 --> 06:58.709
When everyone disappeared, I mean.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.088
We were in a restroom.

07:02.630 --> 07:04.424
We were talking in the same cubicle.

07:04.507 --> 07:06.843
I don't really understand what's going on.

07:07.427 --> 07:08.344
What about you?

07:13.516 --> 07:14.350
Saori…

07:24.068 --> 07:25.027
Work.

07:26.362 --> 07:29.365
I was inside the meeting room
organizing the work materials.

07:30.032 --> 07:33.703
And then everyone disappeared
from the office.

07:34.662 --> 07:37.415
Did you see or hear anything?

07:56.851 --> 07:57.768
Chief?

08:14.702 --> 08:15.828
I don't remember.

08:17.580 --> 08:19.540
I arrived at this place three days ago,

08:20.750 --> 08:24.170
and I was made to join the game
out of nowhere, like everyone else.

08:26.047 --> 08:28.382
Everyone died, except for me.

08:31.093 --> 08:32.803
You used them all as bait?

08:32.887 --> 08:33.888
Say whatever you want.

08:36.015 --> 08:37.308
I just…

08:38.893 --> 08:40.394
I just wanted to survive.

08:51.531 --> 08:52.907
Well…

09:00.373 --> 09:01.832
What game was it?

09:05.336 --> 09:06.754
I was at a subway station.

09:08.965 --> 09:10.841
It was a game where they used poison gas.

09:13.719 --> 09:15.096
Everyone was vomiting blood.

09:16.764 --> 09:18.474
Blood was even flowing out of their eyes.

09:23.396 --> 09:24.313
Isn't it strange?

09:26.148 --> 09:28.109
When everyone disappeared
from this world.

09:28.192 --> 09:29.902
It was yesterday
for the three of us, right?

09:29.986 --> 09:30.987
Yes.

09:31.070 --> 09:32.655
But it was three days ago for Shibuki.

09:33.239 --> 09:34.240
Why at different times?

09:34.991 --> 09:35.825
You're right.

09:36.325 --> 09:38.202
And even the vegetables were rotten.

09:38.911 --> 09:41.038
It was only a few days
since everyone disappeared.

09:41.956 --> 09:43.165
What could be the reason?

09:45.376 --> 09:47.044
Maybe the way time passes

09:47.587 --> 09:49.046
is different from normal?

09:49.755 --> 09:50.590
What?

09:51.382 --> 09:53.134
I don't really know,

09:53.843 --> 09:57.013
but even among us,

09:57.096 --> 10:01.267
the time when people disappeared
is different, right?

10:04.103 --> 10:07.898
Did we time travel
while we were in the restroom?

10:07.982 --> 10:09.483
That's impossible.

10:09.567 --> 10:11.444
But it's also impossible
for people to disappear.

10:11.527 --> 10:12.737
Time traveling does not exist.

10:12.820 --> 10:14.822
How do you explain the game
and people disappearing?

10:14.905 --> 10:16.073
Don't ask me that.

10:16.157 --> 10:17.033
In any case,

10:18.034 --> 10:20.161
One thing we know for sure about this game

10:21.829 --> 10:23.623
is that there's a game master.

10:24.290 --> 10:25.416
Game master?

10:26.208 --> 10:27.877
Someone came up with this game.

10:28.461 --> 10:29.795
That I'm sure of.

10:31.589 --> 10:33.758
While we were in the restroom,

10:33.841 --> 10:36.177
they moved the people in Tokyo away

10:36.260 --> 10:37.720
and prepared for this game?

10:37.803 --> 10:39.263
Then they ascertained our movements

10:41.265 --> 10:43.851
and fired lasers
on people's heads when it was time.

10:46.145 --> 10:47.688
Can a human really do all that?

10:48.773 --> 10:51.233
I'm sure it's possible if they inserted

10:51.317 --> 10:53.736
a highly accurate
GPS microchip into our bodies.

10:54.570 --> 10:56.656
Now you're talking like an IT technician!

10:57.156 --> 10:59.450
But who could be behind that?

11:01.202 --> 11:05.998
Could it be the federal
or state government or something?

11:08.084 --> 11:10.836
I've heard some rumors in my company.

11:11.879 --> 11:14.590
An IT corporation from Europe
wants to conduct an experiment,

11:14.674 --> 11:16.467
where within a VR space,

11:16.550 --> 11:19.679
they attempt to create a world
completely identical to the real world.

11:22.807 --> 11:25.726
But we should be able to distinguish
VR from the real world.

11:28.354 --> 11:29.563
It hurts.

11:31.440 --> 11:33.401
I don't think
VR can cause burns like that.

11:35.861 --> 11:37.238
It must be God.

11:38.155 --> 11:40.491
This must be the work of God.

11:40.574 --> 11:42.702
Otherwise, it's impossible
to explain what's happening.

11:43.327 --> 11:44.787
Don't be stupid.

11:45.454 --> 11:49.291
So God really exists.

11:53.838 --> 11:56.298
Hey, is your injury getting worse?

11:58.592 --> 11:59.427
It's all right.

11:59.927 --> 12:00.970
It's going to be fine.

12:08.644 --> 12:10.896
I think Chota needs to see a doctor.

12:13.232 --> 12:14.650
Given his personality,

12:15.276 --> 12:17.153
he must be enduring the pain.

12:17.653 --> 12:18.654
But he's at his limit.

12:22.450 --> 12:23.367
Arisu.

12:25.786 --> 12:28.831
Let's join the game tomorrow night,
just the two of us.

12:29.665 --> 12:30.583
What?

12:31.625 --> 12:33.711
We still have three days
left on our visas.

12:35.838 --> 12:38.799
It's better to get used to the game
while we still have time to spare.

12:40.259 --> 12:41.761
We'll probably have to

12:41.844 --> 12:45.556
beat the next game
with Chota's injured leg.

12:52.813 --> 12:53.981
Are you all right?

12:54.982 --> 12:56.108
Thank you very much.

12:57.568 --> 13:00.070
If we don't learn how to clear the games
with just the two of us,

13:00.571 --> 13:02.156
we won't be able to protect Chota.

13:04.116 --> 13:05.117
You're right, but…

13:06.786 --> 13:08.162
And we can search for a doctor too.

13:08.662 --> 13:10.456
It's easier to meet people in games.

13:12.958 --> 13:14.418
Do we have to do that again?

13:15.085 --> 13:17.087
There might be a hint
as to what the game is about!

13:22.843 --> 13:23.928
Well, I guess.

13:24.970 --> 13:26.096
If we join the game,

13:26.180 --> 13:27.973
we might be able
to find out their signature.

13:29.934 --> 13:31.060
Signature?

13:32.061 --> 13:34.063
If someone actually made this game,

13:35.731 --> 13:39.026
we will definitely be able to find out
their characteristics through the games.

13:39.985 --> 13:41.153
If we can discover that,

13:41.695 --> 13:43.948
we might be able to figure out
a strategy for the game.

14:04.134 --> 14:09.390
TOEI SENDAGAYA APARTMENT

14:37.793 --> 14:40.254
ONE PER PERSON

14:41.046 --> 14:43.048
FACIAL RECOGNITION IN PROGRESS
PLEASE WAIT A MOMENT

14:44.300 --> 14:45.759
THERE ARE CURRENTLY TEN PARTICIPANTS.

14:45.843 --> 14:48.095
Please wait until the game commences.

14:48.178 --> 14:51.599
One minute until registration closes.

14:52.975 --> 14:54.810
Excuse me.

14:55.394 --> 14:58.230
Where did all the people in Tokyo go?

15:03.652 --> 15:04.653
This thing--

15:04.737 --> 15:07.531
- There are so many people.
- I wonder if there's a doctor here.

15:13.704 --> 15:15.331
ONE PER PERSON

15:44.026 --> 15:46.195
Registration has closed.

15:47.029 --> 15:51.283
There are a total of 13 participants.
The game will now commence.

15:52.743 --> 15:53.577
Excuse me.

15:54.578 --> 15:56.330
Just what is this?

15:57.206 --> 15:59.833
I ended up here.
I have no idea what's going on.

16:01.001 --> 16:02.836
- It's a game.
- Stop it.

16:03.504 --> 16:05.381
Beginners will only get in our way.

16:06.465 --> 16:07.466
It doesn't feel great,

16:08.634 --> 16:10.970
but it might be a good idea
to act like Shibuki did.

16:13.597 --> 16:16.558
Difficulty, Five of Spades.

16:20.688 --> 16:22.022
Five of Spades?

16:22.731 --> 16:23.899
It's a physical game.

16:24.483 --> 16:26.110
Strength is everything here.

16:26.610 --> 16:28.195
I'm Nitobe. Nice to meet you.

16:29.655 --> 16:32.741
- Each mark has a different meaning?
- Exactly!

16:33.951 --> 16:37.121
The mark on a trump card
signifies the game's genre.

16:37.913 --> 16:40.749
Club refers to a team battle,
and Diamond refers to a battle of wits.

16:40.833 --> 16:41.959
As for Heart…

16:43.502 --> 16:45.129
It's the most troublesome one.

16:45.796 --> 16:47.047
"Troublesome"?

16:48.048 --> 16:50.759
It's a game of betrayal
where you play with people's hearts.

16:53.971 --> 16:55.097
What about the numbers?

16:55.681 --> 16:56.640
The difficulty level.

16:57.808 --> 17:00.561
The larger the number,

17:00.644 --> 17:01.854
the harder it is to clear.

17:04.148 --> 17:06.483
Game, "A Game of Tag."

17:07.526 --> 17:11.155
Rule. Run away from the tagger.

17:12.740 --> 17:13.741
What?

17:14.408 --> 17:15.743
A Game of Tag?

17:17.411 --> 17:20.164
- Who's the tagger?
- How should I know?

17:21.331 --> 17:22.166
Clear condition.

17:23.167 --> 17:24.376
Discover the safezone

17:24.460 --> 17:27.171
hidden in one of the building rooms
within the time limit.

17:27.254 --> 17:29.757
You clear the game
when this objective is fulfilled.

17:30.340 --> 17:32.760
Time limit, 20 minutes.

17:34.303 --> 17:35.387
After 20 minutes has passed,

17:35.471 --> 17:39.141
the time bomb hidden
in the building will explode.

17:55.491 --> 17:57.493
TOEI SENDAGAYA APARTMENT

18:06.460 --> 18:07.669
O Holy Mother.

18:08.462 --> 18:11.423
Please save us from our tainted souls.

18:12.966 --> 18:14.802
Our smiles are the light of hope.

18:16.095 --> 18:18.305
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

18:19.848 --> 18:24.269
O Holy Mother.
Please save us from our tainted souls.

18:25.646 --> 18:27.731
Our smiles are the light of hope.

18:28.732 --> 18:30.859
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

18:31.610 --> 18:33.195
So you believe in God.

18:38.283 --> 18:39.118
Here you go.

18:41.036 --> 18:43.997
I've also been doing nothing
but praying recently.

18:45.624 --> 18:47.543
I don't believe in God.

18:48.043 --> 18:51.213
But my mom
has always been super religious.

18:54.216 --> 18:56.176
Because of that, I was bullied in school.

18:56.760 --> 18:58.846
But Arisu and Karube saved me.

19:01.056 --> 19:02.683
They are good friends.

19:05.144 --> 19:08.021
Karube is good at fighting
and is popular with the girls,

19:08.856 --> 19:12.651
while Arisu is clever
and comes from a reputable family.

19:13.652 --> 19:14.820
Someone like me,

19:14.903 --> 19:18.240
I come from a poor family,
and I don't have anything I'm good at.

19:18.949 --> 19:23.245
And now that I'm injured,
I have to rely on everyone else again.

19:25.747 --> 19:30.002
Humans like it
when someone weaker follows them

19:31.044 --> 19:32.504
because it makes them feel at ease.

19:34.089 --> 19:35.424
But not them.

19:35.507 --> 19:38.218
Do you think you'll be able to
join the next game with them?

19:41.763 --> 19:42.931
Your leg is injured, you know?

19:46.310 --> 19:47.811
They are different.

19:47.895 --> 19:50.898
Then will you die for your friends' sake?

20:00.324 --> 20:02.701
Two minutes until the game starts.

20:04.620 --> 20:05.787
Stop following us.

20:07.122 --> 20:08.248
I'm trying to gauge you guys.

20:08.332 --> 20:10.584
Maybe both of you are suitable
to be my allies.

20:10.667 --> 20:11.501
What a joke.

20:12.002 --> 20:14.379
- Are you a doctor?
- No, I'm a real estate agent.

20:15.297 --> 20:16.882
How many times have you played the game?

20:16.965 --> 20:19.551
Let's see, maybe five times?

20:20.135 --> 20:21.511
And you've always won?

20:21.595 --> 20:22.554
Well, I guess.

20:24.431 --> 20:26.225
Where should I go?

20:26.308 --> 20:27.684
I don't know!

20:28.185 --> 20:29.561
You can only rely on yourself.

20:46.703 --> 20:48.622
If you can choose
your starting position,

20:49.498 --> 20:50.958
this is the perfect location.

21:05.555 --> 21:06.556
What?

21:07.432 --> 21:08.767
That's nasty.

21:16.775 --> 21:17.859
Let's see…

21:18.986 --> 21:21.571
Everyone looks like
they're about to die, as usual.

21:23.865 --> 21:27.244
I guess you've always been
betrayed by people, Shibuki.

21:27.327 --> 21:29.454
You've never met anyone decent.

21:31.540 --> 21:32.374
That's right.

21:38.338 --> 21:40.132
The same goes for you, right, Chota?

21:44.636 --> 21:46.805
O Holy Mother…

21:46.888 --> 21:48.473
Please save us

21:49.141 --> 21:50.892
from our tainted souls.

21:58.025 --> 21:59.234
You're wrong.

22:12.789 --> 22:14.207
It must have been tough for you.

22:39.024 --> 22:41.610
The game will now commence.

22:42.819 --> 22:45.364
The time limit is 20 minutes.

22:45.989 --> 22:47.908
Game start.

22:52.454 --> 22:53.997
The tagger is on the move.

24:47.110 --> 24:49.446
Anyway, let's just search
for an unlocked door.

24:59.623 --> 25:01.666
We won't make it if we dawdle like this!

25:20.977 --> 25:22.562
Three minutes have passed.

25:39.162 --> 25:40.413
What was that sound?

26:08.400 --> 26:09.317
He's dead.

26:36.761 --> 26:37.596
Arisu!

26:39.889 --> 26:41.600
- Run!
- Go!

26:43.018 --> 26:44.394
- Arisu!
- Run!

26:44.477 --> 26:45.895
- Down!
- Hurry up!

26:48.565 --> 26:49.649
Hurry up!

26:50.442 --> 26:53.236
- Move aside!
- What's with you?

26:53.320 --> 26:54.154
Hey!

26:54.863 --> 26:56.281
- Arisu, hurry!
- Karube, wait!

27:18.511 --> 27:19.763
Chota,

27:20.847 --> 27:22.223
I can trust you, right?

27:37.280 --> 27:38.365
When it happened,

27:39.908 --> 27:41.868
I was actually having sex
with my superior.

27:45.163 --> 27:46.498
I hated him.

27:48.875 --> 27:50.794
Didn't you say you were working?

27:52.212 --> 27:53.880
They are not even my allies.

27:54.631 --> 27:56.758
Why do I need to tell them the truth?

28:19.114 --> 28:20.615
Since we're both the same,

28:21.616 --> 28:22.826
we should get along.

28:47.392 --> 28:48.560
In order to live…

29:02.031 --> 29:02.991
This is impossible.

29:03.074 --> 29:05.368
This is crazy. I can't do this!

29:52.332 --> 29:53.833
Hurry up, Mai!

29:58.838 --> 29:59.714
Mai!

30:01.758 --> 30:02.884
Aya.

30:07.347 --> 30:09.182
I'll fucking kill you!

30:09.974 --> 30:11.059
Don't come closer!

30:21.903 --> 30:24.322
I told you the truth
because it's you, Chota.

30:36.292 --> 30:38.586
O Holy Mother…

30:40.547 --> 30:41.714
Holy Mother…

30:45.510 --> 30:48.096
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

30:49.472 --> 30:50.890
O Holy Mother…

30:52.183 --> 30:53.518
Wait for me, okay?

30:54.227 --> 30:55.937
…from our tainted souls.

30:57.021 --> 30:59.649
Our smiles are the light of hope.

31:00.483 --> 31:02.902
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

31:04.362 --> 31:05.697
O Holy Mother,

31:06.698 --> 31:10.034
Please save us from our tainted souls.

31:10.118 --> 31:11.327
Please accept this.

31:12.078 --> 31:14.539
Our smiles are the light of hope.

31:15.456 --> 31:17.959
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

31:19.085 --> 31:20.503
Very well, this way.

31:21.504 --> 31:25.049
O Holy Mother.

31:39.230 --> 31:41.608
- Let's go over there.
- Let's pray together.

31:42.358 --> 31:43.484
O Holy Mother.

31:44.819 --> 31:46.362
Please save us

31:47.614 --> 31:49.240
from our tainted souls.

31:50.867 --> 31:52.285
…from our tainted souls.

31:55.788 --> 31:58.291
O Holy Mother.

32:01.836 --> 32:02.670
Please.

32:03.463 --> 32:04.881
Save them.

32:08.092 --> 32:09.510
What should we do, Arisu?

32:10.595 --> 32:12.680
Can you come up with any solution?

32:12.764 --> 32:15.558
We can't clear this game
with something like that!

32:15.642 --> 32:17.810
- Just think, Arisu!
- Then you think of one!

32:38.373 --> 32:39.958
The tagger didn't see us.

32:41.250 --> 32:43.252
His field of vision
is narrowed due to the mask!

32:43.878 --> 32:45.630
It's his weak point!

32:46.214 --> 32:47.882
That could be the key!

32:53.054 --> 32:54.138
- Everyone!
- Hey!

32:54.222 --> 32:56.683
The tagger is currently
at the second level of the central area!

32:56.766 --> 32:57.809
Stop it. You'll get killed!

32:57.892 --> 33:00.186
The tagger has bad vision
because of his mask!

33:00.269 --> 33:02.313
Let's inform each other
of the tagger's location

33:02.397 --> 33:04.357
and search for the safezone together!

33:07.235 --> 33:08.736
It's a good idea,

33:09.696 --> 33:11.406
but no one will respond.

33:16.077 --> 33:18.955
The tagger is moving
from the fourth level of the central area!

33:19.038 --> 33:20.623
Anyone nearby, run!

33:22.542 --> 33:23.376
Really?

33:25.795 --> 33:27.255
- Quick, run away!
- What?

33:28.381 --> 33:29.674
I'm sorry.

33:35.680 --> 33:37.015
A climber?

33:37.765 --> 33:38.766
She's pretty good.

33:41.936 --> 33:44.439
Eight minutes until the game ends.

33:45.648 --> 33:48.901
There are currently seven survivors.

34:32.653 --> 34:34.489
Hey!

34:35.073 --> 34:37.283
Over here! Hey!

34:38.326 --> 34:39.368
Hey!

34:42.789 --> 34:43.956
Hey Arisu!

34:44.665 --> 34:46.375
We don't have the time
to help someone else!

34:47.210 --> 34:48.920
Don't just sit there, move!

34:52.757 --> 34:53.841
Hey, move it!

35:05.561 --> 35:06.771
Shall we begin?

35:12.860 --> 35:13.861
Arisu!

35:14.612 --> 35:16.197
You go first!

35:17.073 --> 35:18.241
Damn it.

35:18.991 --> 35:20.576
Let's take the tagger out.

35:20.660 --> 35:23.079
We're going up against a machine gun here!

35:23.162 --> 35:25.248
No, that's a human.

35:28.918 --> 35:33.214
The tagger is 190cm tall and weighs 90kg.
Their dominant hand is their right hand.

35:33.297 --> 35:35.383
His shooting is rudimentary.

35:35.466 --> 35:38.219
Most likely
an ex-SDF officer or policeman.

35:40.096 --> 35:41.222
I got it.

35:48.604 --> 35:49.814
Take this.

35:56.195 --> 35:57.446
Let's go hunt down the tagger.

36:01.325 --> 36:02.952
Go search for the safezone.

36:04.078 --> 36:04.912
What?

36:05.788 --> 36:06.622
Hey!

36:07.123 --> 36:09.000
- Don't command us!
- I got it.

36:09.500 --> 36:10.501
I'll search from the top.

36:11.961 --> 36:12.879
Arisu!

36:13.379 --> 36:15.756
- Don't do that.
- We don't have any other choice.

36:16.299 --> 36:17.925
I checked the 5th floor on the south block

36:18.009 --> 36:19.886
and the 6th floor on
the east and south blocks.

36:20.803 --> 36:22.805
Let's split up
and search for the safezone.

36:23.306 --> 36:24.932
I haven't checked
the 1st and 2nd floors.

36:25.016 --> 36:27.101
Understood. I'll go check it out.

36:28.144 --> 36:29.145
- Hey!
- Hey!

36:35.735 --> 36:37.820
It's time to get rid of the tagger.

36:42.992 --> 36:45.036
Five minutes remaining.

36:47.788 --> 36:48.706
See you later.

36:49.874 --> 36:50.791
Okay.

37:07.975 --> 37:09.852
Just where is the safezone?

37:15.149 --> 37:17.818
Calm down. Relax and think.

37:24.867 --> 37:26.702
Come on, follow me.

37:28.829 --> 37:30.873
He wields a MAC-10

37:30.957 --> 37:33.918
and finishes shooting his 32-round ammo
in 1.5 seconds.

37:35.711 --> 37:37.797
We'll go for him when he's reloading.

37:46.097 --> 37:47.181
I'm over here!

37:50.518 --> 37:52.687
Just come at me. I dare you!

38:01.821 --> 38:02.863
Aguni?

38:05.449 --> 38:06.325
Aguni?

38:07.326 --> 38:08.244
Aguni!

38:12.790 --> 38:13.958
You just let him die?

39:40.419 --> 39:43.005
Think.

40:02.691 --> 40:05.736
Why did he shoot
from such a long distance?

40:21.127 --> 40:22.378
So you realized that too?

40:23.587 --> 40:25.756
Yes. The safezone is in this apartment.

40:34.682 --> 40:35.850
Aren't you going to open it?

40:37.351 --> 40:38.978
Why did the tagger chase us?

40:40.187 --> 40:41.647
They could have just waited here.

40:43.441 --> 40:45.276
Seems like there's something else
we don't know.

40:47.945 --> 40:48.779
However,

40:49.280 --> 40:50.322
if you don't open it…

40:56.454 --> 40:59.123
Three minutes until the game concludes.

41:49.298 --> 41:50.132
Look out!

42:01.227 --> 42:02.770
It never hurts to be prepared--

42:23.874 --> 42:25.376
PUSH BOTH BUTTONS
AT ONCE TO CLEAR GAME

42:25.459 --> 42:26.377
Damn it.

42:31.507 --> 42:32.633
Someone, please come over!

42:33.133 --> 42:36.637
The safezone is in Apartment 406!

42:38.180 --> 42:39.765
It's impossible to clear the game alone!

42:39.848 --> 42:41.433
We need two people to do this!

42:42.601 --> 42:44.144
Seriously?

42:44.728 --> 42:45.896
Arisu!

43:11.213 --> 43:13.132
This is getting interesting, huh?

43:23.684 --> 43:26.145
Time remaining, one minute.

43:44.204 --> 43:45.039
Someone!

43:45.956 --> 43:46.915
Please come!

44:01.680 --> 44:04.642
Time remaining, thirty seconds.

44:18.447 --> 44:19.615
Twenty seconds.

44:31.210 --> 44:32.044
You called?

44:32.127 --> 44:33.295
Ten seconds.

44:34.463 --> 44:35.381
Hey!

44:43.222 --> 44:44.306
Five.

44:44.390 --> 44:45.641
- Four.
- The buttons!

44:45.724 --> 44:46.934
Three.

44:47.017 --> 44:49.061
Two. One.

45:03.117 --> 45:04.034
Game clear.

45:04.743 --> 45:06.161
Congratulations.

45:34.606 --> 45:35.607
Excuse me.

46:17.399 --> 46:18.275
This person…

46:19.818 --> 46:21.779
Were they also made
to participate in the game?

46:49.807 --> 46:52.726
Answer…

46:52.810 --> 46:54.144
…in our hands now.

46:55.979 --> 46:56.897
"Answer"?

46:59.233 --> 47:00.526
Hey, can you hear me?

47:02.236 --> 47:04.196
Hey, what's this "answer"
you're talking about?

47:06.406 --> 47:07.241
Return.

47:07.741 --> 47:10.536
The answer is in our hands now.

47:11.703 --> 47:13.747
Return to the Beach.

47:15.082 --> 47:16.250
"The Beach"?

47:29.888 --> 47:31.056
Return.

47:31.682 --> 47:33.684
Return to the Beach.

47:35.269 --> 47:37.271
Return to the Beach.

49:41.436 --> 49:44.690
Subtitle translation by: Qianni Lu
